<h2>Referensi</h2>
Referensi.
Now I made the plot for So Near and Yet So Far (the Scat Cat remake) Here's the plot.
Plot:
Bea and Dot realize that something crashed in Lalaloopsy Land and go to investigate. At the location, they found a flickering pink acorn and broken buttons. After this find, Bea went to her house to investigate more of these objects while Dot takes them to her house.
Later Dot returns home where she notices that her rocket has the light on and goes to check. It is there that she finds a shy Haley breaking into her decoration rocket, she approaches her for peaceful purposes and they become friends with her. Dot invites her to have breakfast at Berry 's , but her eggs caught her eye because of their spaceship-like shape. Haley then stands on her head in an attempt to read, this feat catches the attention of the girls and they invite her to see Peanut.
Peanut shows Haley a unicycle act, but the latter's pet causes her to crash. Later Haley is seen more interested in jumping on a trampoline holding Haley's cracked egg as a way of telling the girls that she wants to leave, but the girls take this to mean that she wants to keep playing. And then, Haley teaches how to do her dance from Alien Music Camp. They decide to do the Wiggle Dance together before Brody can ask what the Wiggle Dance is. Haley Galaxy and Dot Starlight do the Wiggle Dance. Haley Galaxy wishes there were more people to do The Wiggle Dance. The Schwartzman Quartet enters, conveniently, doing The Wiggle Dance with Haley Galaxy and Dot Starlight. Jewel does the wiggle dance, too. After this, The Schwartzman Quartet leaves. After her unsuccessful attempt, she becomes sad and Peanut suggests to Dot that she take her to Bea's, if she has a book on talking to aliens.
Bea looks for a book, but can't find any. Later, Dot tries to communicate with Haley and teaches her basic English to communicate. It is then that Haley tells her her story: She is an alien from the chocolate milky way who while navigating the stars, her ship crashed and she was trying to find a way to repair her ship. Dot then along with Berry, Peanut and Ace set out to repair the ship. She asks Brody if he agrees, but notices Brody is not next to her like earlier. She finds Brody sitting alone on the piano. Jewel asks why Brody is sitting all by himself. Brody says that he just felt like being alone. Haley Galaxy and Dot Starlight run through them. Jewel doesn't think Brody is okay, and Brody says he is jealous of Haley Galaxy and Dot Starlight. Brody thinks Haley likes Dot more than her. Jewel says this isn't true and plays "Super Swell Friends" on the piano. 
After the song, In Ace's garage, Monita tells him that she is having a party with the other pets. Ace then plays with them piggyback, hide and seek, musical chairs and go-karts.
Ace is interrupted as he wanted to play gokarts with the pets so he would build a glass dome for Haley. Meanwhile the girls take advantage of gluing the loose parts of the ship, Ace delivers the dome made and they give him fuel based on chocolate milk. After two failed takeoff attempts involving Peanut's cannon and springboard, they use Ace's car to do so and succeed. Ace, who ended up with a gokart without wheels because it was used to power the ship, has fun with the pets by sledding it through the snow. The episode concludes with Dot speaking Haley's alien language to Bird.
